    <briefdescription>
<para>Malformed XML recovery scenario for BPMN parser. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> BPMN with missing required attributes, broken nesting, invalid schema <linebreak/>
 <bold>Varieties:</bold> Missing required attributes, unclosed tags, invalid attribute values <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Explicit error with actionable message (not silent skip) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> <computeroutput>PROC_DESERIALISE_FAILED</computeroutput> with remediation hint <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Error code explicitly returned</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Error message is actionable (suggests fix)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No partial/corrupted model state</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Latency &lt;100 ms (P95) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
